<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN KREDIETBANK LAUNCHES NEW FUNDS.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN KREDIETBANK LAUNCHES NEW FUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Kredietbank said on Friday it was launching four new open-ended investment funds targeted at retail investors.</p>
<p>The funds will invest respectively in Japanese, Belgian and Dutch equities as well as in telecoms shares.</p>
<p>The four funds go on sale on June 30.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
